# using https://sequencediagram.org/
title The T-Project : Main loop overview

participant "TNTPROJECT\nentry point" as TNTPROJECT
participant "TNT2\nGame loop" as TNT2
participant "TNT3\nCity load" as TNT3
participant "TNT1\nDraw World" as TNT1

participant "TNT14\nFight" as TNT14

participant "TNT13\nDraw city" as TNT13

participant "TNT10\nUser menu" as TNT10

participant "TNT16\nShop prices init" as TNT16
participant "TNT11\nShop" as TNT11

participant "TNT15\nscript dialogs" as TNT15

TNTPROJECT->TNT2:<new game>\n   or\n<load game>
activate TNT2
TNT2-->TNT3:At game startup, load city.\nSee later sequence
TNT3-->TNT2:back to world (F6)
note over TNT2:Lbl 9
TNT2->TNT1:Draw world map
space
activate TNT2
note over TNT2:Lbl 8 | Lbl S\nWorld main loop
TNT2->TNT14: If move counter down to zero → fight
TNT2->TNT2: If heliport\n→ Lbl H
expandable− Special code for treasure
TNT2->TNT15: A=60 And B=42 And Not Mat Z[10,2 : script
end
TNT2->TNT10: Getkey θ=48 → user menu
expandable− Not Int 30Ran# → Street vendor
TNT2->TNT16:initialize shop prices
TNT2->TNT11:display shop
end
expandable− Entering a city
TNT2->TNT3:Tests if user enters a city
TNT3->TNT13:Draw city
end